Once you hit the sanctum, the number used to generate monsters
hits its max, and it never goes down from that point on.  So while
protectionist can cause weaker monsters to be generated until
then, the result is a smaller possible pool of weak monsters after
you get the Amulet.  While the strategy of the game does change
at that point from killing most monsters standing in your way to
running up the levels, how strong the monsters are that you face
does matter.



